{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/249471-madness-dossier-in-hunter","id":249471,"title":"Madness Dossier in Hunter?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-04T21:32:41-07:00","id":249471,"title":"Madness Dossier in Hunter?","content":"Ever since I bought the gurps book Madness Dossier I've thought they'd make an interesting inspiration for a hunter conspiracy.<br /> <br /> For anyone not a gurps fan, in Madness Dossier a joint british/american secret organization deals with the fact that history is a lie. The Red Kings, the <span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Anunnaki, ruled the world, even our languages were designed to make us slaves.<br /> <br /> Then humanity rebelled, perhaps they were led by a rogue servant of the red kings, perhaps they spoke a language that had mutated enough to free them from over control, nobody knows, but when humanity rebelled history itself was altered into the history we know of now.<br /> <br /> So the red kings sleep, but their servants (the various monsters from Sumerian myth) seek to turn reality back to its true form, with all of humanity ruled by the Red Kings.<br /> <br /> Project Sandman seeks to prevent that from happening, they are sort of the mental equivalent of Cheiron in resources: understanding of memes to manipulate people, unlocking cinematic martial arts skills, cracking open people's skulls to hook their brains up to computers, runes that magic like effects on people by using the linguistic programming left in humanity, even programming in new personalities so that their agents can be &quot;ridden&quot; like a cheval. <br /> <br /> So does that sound like something that can be mined for hunter the vigil to you folks? <br /> <br /> <br /> </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-08T13:46:36-07:00","id":252629,"title":"","content":"My gut reaction would be to mine it for <b>Mage</b> ideas, given the conceptual similarities between the Exarchs and the Red Kings, acts of Imperium and Reality Quakes, and the Lie and the embedded programming of humanity featured in <b>Madness Dossier</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-08T22:48:58-07:00","id":253038,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> Hmm, hadn't thought about that.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> My initial thought was to make it even darker and tie the Red Kings to the Prince of 100,000 leaves, which would just mean reskinning the Red king's minions as egyptian monsters and of course would mean taking away the arguable utopian nature of the Red Kings reign. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> For anyone who doesn't know anything about the setting, allegedly during the red kings reign there was no war or crime, all it took was humans having no free will. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> Another thought was to tie in the God-Machine, perhaps the reign of the red kings was replaced by the reign of the god-machine, in which case this hypothetical conspiracy might get help from angels and perhaps get hassled by demons.</span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T17:58:19-07:00","id":265033,"title":"","content":"Wouldn't it be the other way around if they were trying to stop the godmachine? Help from demons and hassle from angels.<br /> <br /> Anyway, that does fit in with Marko Singes testament with the red kings replaced by the first children.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Do the dead dare walk the Earth before my eyes? Will the undead raise an army, fall in, and advance? Will those who would abandon God and embrace the heretical order DARE to presume to meet my gaze!? Iscariot will not allow it. <b>I</b> will not allow it.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3889-ninjasantaclause","name":"Ninjasantaclause","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T02:28:31-07:00","id":268111,"title":"","content":"No, you misunderstood, I suggested the red kings as the reign before the god-machine, so in that scenario by stopping the red kings they'd be helping the god-machine, so hassle from demons and help from angels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}